ng the largest global aerospace manufacturers; it is the fourth-largest defense contractor in the world based on 2022 revenue and is the largest exporter in the United States by dollar value. Boeing was founded in 1916 by William E. Boeing in Seattle, Washington. The present corporation is the result of the Boeing acquisition of McDonnell Douglas on August 1, 1997.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boeing"},"ru":{"t":"Boeing","x":"The Boeing Company («Бо́инг») — американская корпорация, один из крупнейших в мире производителей авиационной, космической и военной техники. С середины 2022 года штаб-квартира находится в Арлингтоне.","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boeing"}},"wiki_at":"2026-10-22T14:18:36.912486+00:00"}